 Modelfy MCP 
 Let any AI agent create product photos with Modelfy: Claude, ChatGPT, Codex, Cursor, or your own. 
 Add it 
 https://dvds-scale-save-modification.trycloudflare.com/mcp 
 In Claude Code: 
 claude mcp add --transport http --scope user modelfy https://dvds-scale-save-modification.trycloudflare.com/mcp 
 Chat assistants (claude.ai, Claude Desktop, ChatGPT) sign in with your Modelfy account once. Coding agents and bots can use an API key in the Authorization: Bearer header. Every client, step by step: Connect your agent . 
 Get a key 

 Try it now, no account: curl -X POST https://dvds-scale-save-modification.trycloudflare.com/sandbox/keys gives a free sandbox key. Nothing is spent; photos are samples. 
 Device login: POST https://dvds-scale-save-modification.trycloudflare.com/device/code , open the link it returns, approve, then poll POST https://dvds-scale-save-modification.trycloudflare.com/device/token . The key comes to your agent; nobody copies it. 
 By hand: create a key in your Modelfy account and paste it. 

 Spending 
 Every session is planned first with its exact price ( plan_photos ). In a chat the person confirms it; a live API key spends only within the credit budget its owner set. 
 Docs 
 All pages · llms.txt · llms-full.txt · connected agents call get_docs . 



